.TH WERKMEISTER-PAUSE 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-pause \- Freeze a workspace's running containers and hold its Claude session until resume
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister pause\fR [feature]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Freezes a workspace's running containers and holds its Claude session until \fBwerkmeister resume\fR. Nothing is removed: the slot, the containers and their state stay as they are.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister pause my\-feature
werkmeister resume my\-feature
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
